=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: an xfail mark bound to a name and never applied disables nothing
origin: #260 M2: `xfail_on_ci = pytest.mark.xfail(...)` was read as a module-level xfail call and
origin2: blocked the module at high; pytest runs the test (1 passed).
=== before: tests/test_calc.py ===
import sys

import pytest


def test_add():
    assert 1 + 1 == 2
=== after: tests/test_calc.py ===
import sys

import pytest

xfail_on_ci = pytest.mark.xfail(reason="flaky on CI")


def test_add():
    assert 1 + 1 == 2
